  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Skip the move-in/move-out traffic and start enjoying your beach vacation right away! Walking distance to everything, Summer Wind is a luxury 4bd/4.5ba in picturesque 30a/Rosemary Beach, offering a quiet retreat among the pines with direct access to both 30a and Hwy98. Perfect for one or two young families or a larger group of friends, this home features king and queen en suites, as well as two bunk rooms, also en suite - one with 2 queens below 2 twins, the other with 6 twin beds. Conveniently located near the community pool, this tastefully-designed home offers deeded beach access with tram service to the beach, as well as an outdoor shower. With an open floor plan on the main level, and a second living area on the third floor, this home ensures adults and children, alike, can relax and pursue their own downtime interests for a true vacation. Pet-friendly. Sleeps up to 16.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "4BD/4.5BA Perfect for 1-2 Families in heart of 30a/Rosemary Bch w/HWY98 access"
        }
      ],
